config SCSC_MX
	tristate "Samsung SCSC Maxwell (WLBT) core driver"
	depends on (ARCH_EXYNOS && OF) || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on EXYNOS_ACPM_PROTOCOL
	depends on CFG80211
	depends on BT
	help
	  Core driver for the Samsung SCSC "Maxwell" WLBT companion chip
	  (WiFi/BT combo) found on several Exynos-based Samsung phones.

	  This manages the AP<->WLBT mailbox register windows and chip
	  power/reset sequencing via PMU_ALIVE, boots firmware onto the
	  chip, and carries the HIP4 transport and FAPI signal layer. It
	  registers a cfg80211 interface with scan, association, and a data
	  path, and a hci_dev with HCI command/event and ACL data over the
	  BSMHCP rings. WLAN and BT can run concurrently on this firmware
	  and both start by default.

	  Say M here to build it as a module, so it can be reloaded while
	  bringing the chip up without rebuilding/reflashing the kernel.
